OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1787084321
OL,3,COmbudsman to examine accessibility of
OL,4,Ccare for those with learning disability
OL,6,FThe accessibility of Northern
OL,7,FIreland's health trusts for those with
OL,8,Fa learning disability is set to be
OL,9,Fexamined.
OL,11,FPublic Services Ombudsman Margaret
OL,12,FKelly said her office's own initiative
OL,13,Finvestigation will examine whether the
OL,14,Ftrusts provide effective, accessible
OL,15,Fand safe healthcare to people with a
OL,16,Flearning disability.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/5
