PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1787084321
OL,3,COmbudsman to examine accessibility of
OL,4,Ccare for those with learning disability
OL,6,FIt has been described as a system-wide
OL,7,Finvestigation which will look at how
OL,8,Ftrusts record information about a
OL,9,Fperson's learning disability and how
OL,10,Fthe information is used to provide
OL,11,Fthem with appropriate care.
OL,13,FIt will also look at how they are
OL,14,Fcared for when they are admitted to
OL,15,Fhospital unexpectedly, including how
OL,16,Fcare plans and other assessment tools
OL,17,Fare used to meet their individual
OL,18,Fneeds.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1787084321
OL,3,COmbudsman to examine accessibility of
OL,4,Ccare for those with learning disability
OL,6,FIn addition, consideration will be
OL,7,Fgiven to how the trusts, the strategic
OL,8,Fplanning and performance group, and
OL,9,Fthe Public Health Agency use
OL,10,Finformation from complaints,
OL,11,Finvestigations, and adverse incidents
OL,12,Finvolving people with a learning
OL,13,Fdisability to prevent issues
OL,14,Frecurring, and to make improvements.
OL,16,FMs Kelly said she is particularly
OL,17,Fconcerned around cases of avoidable
OL,18,Fharm to individuals.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
