PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1787084321
OL,3,COmbudsman to examine accessibility of
OL,4,Ccare for those with learning disability
OL,6,F"Nipso (Northern Ireland Public
OL,7,FServices Ombudsman) has identified
OL,8,Fconcerns about the quality of health
OL,9,Fcare and life expectancy for people
OL,10,Fwith a learning disability in Northern
OL,11,FIreland, from both our own case work
OL,12,Fand a range of investigations and
OL,13,Fstudies," she said.
OL,15,F"I am particularly concerned about
OL,16,Fcases of avoidable harm to
OL,17,Findividuals, or when someone has died
OL,18,Fbecause of inadequate care and
OL,19,Ftreatment."
